sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Usuário
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant CTRL as Controller
    participant GRD as Guardião
    participant LIB as Bibliotecário
    participant SCHED as Scheduler
    participant AG as Agente
    participant JUDGE as Judge
    participant OLLAMA as Ollama

    Note over U,OLLAMA: Fluxo de Processamento de Tarefa

    U->>FE: Submit Prompt
    FE->>CTRL: POST /api/enxame/mission
    CTRL->>GRD: validate(query)
    
    alt Segurança Aprovada
        GRD-->>CTRL: ValidationResult(allowed=true)
        CTRL->>LIB: search(query)
        LIB->>QDRANT: Vector Search
        QDRANT-->>LIB: Chunks Context
        LIB->>WEB: Fallback (se necessário)
        WEB-->>LIB: Web Results
        LIB-->>CTRL: Context Data
        
        CTRL->>SCHED: select_agent(query)
        SCHED->>AG: Query Capabilities
        AG-->>SCHED: Specialties + Load
        SCHED-->>CTRL: Selected Node ID
        
        CTRL->>AG: TASK_DISPATCH(subtasks)
        AG->>AG: Hot-load Plugin
        AG->>POOL: Queue Work Items
        POOL->>WORKER: Execute Task
        WORKER->>OLLAMA: Generate(prompt)
        OLLAMA-->>WORKER: Response
        WORKER-->>POOL: Result
        AG-->>CTRL: TASK_RESULT
        
        CTRL->>JUDGE: evaluate(results)
        JUDGE->>JUDGE: Synthesize Answer
        JUDGE-->>CTRL: Final Answer
        CTRL-->>FE: Mission Complete
        FE-->>U: Display Result
        
    else Segurança Bloqueada
        GRD-->>CTRL: ValidationResult(allowed=false)
        CTRL-->>FE: Blocked Response
        FE-->>U: Error Message
    end
